Odyssey Exploration (Odyssey.html)
  └─► Saves shortlisted lifestyles to `RetirementOdysseySelection`

Preference Discovery (retirement-preference-discovery.html)
  └─► Saves priorities & non-negotiables to `RetirementDiscoverySelection`

Retirement Feasibility Engine (financial-feasibility-audit.html)
  └─► Saves committed choice, locations & budget to `WealthLandingSelectedRoadmap`

U.S. Retirement City Matcher (UScitymatcher.html)
  └─► Reads `WealthLandingSelectedRoadmap`
  └─► Preloads Path, Overseas Base & Target Budget into Section 2 Header
  └─► Updates `WealthLandingSelectedRoadmap` with chosen U.S. city when saved

